<title>SWEDEN: Swedish PM calls special cabinet meeting.</title>
<headline>Swedish PM calls special cabinet meeting.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Prime Minister Goran Persson called a special cabinet meeting, a spokesman for Persson said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Leif-Ake Falk told Reuters: &quot;There will be an extra cabinet meeting today. But I have no information on exactly when it will be.&quot;</p>
<p>Swedish radio reported earlier that Persson was about to announce a cabinet reshuffle.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
